# Capability → MCP (resolved map)

> Пример. Актуальный маппинг — в `framework/capabilities/registry.yaml`.
> Агент использует этот файл (или registry) для резолва capability → вызов tool.

## Резолв capability → tool

| Capability | Server | Tool |
|------------|--------|------|
| navigate_symbol | lsp-bridge | navigate_symbol |
| get_call_graph | lsp-bridge | get_call_graph |
| get_diagnostics | lsp-bridge | get_diagnostics |
| get_code_actions | lsp-bridge | get_code_actions |
| rename_symbol | lsp-bridge | rename_symbol |
| search_ssl_functions | lsp-bridge | search_ssl_functions |
| check_syntax | test-runner | check_syntax |
| run_tests | test-runner | run_tests |
| build_project | test-runner | build_project |
| dump_config | test-runner | dump_config |
| list_metadata_objects | 1c-mcp | list_metadata_objects |
| get_metadata_structure | 1c-mcp | get_metadata_structure |
| validate_query | 1c-mcp | validate_query |
| execute_query | 1c-mcp | execute_query |
| parse_nav_link | 1c-mcp | parse_nav_link |
| get_nav_link | 1c-mcp | get_nav_link |
| search_syntax_reference | platform-context | search_syntax_reference |
| get_type_info | platform-context | get_type_info |
| ask_ai_assistant | copilot-proxy | ask_1c_ai |
| search_event_log | log-checker | search_event_log |
| search_tech_log | log-checker | search_tech_log |
| configure_tech_log | log-checker | configure_tech_log |
| browser_navigate | playwright | browser_navigate |
| browser_snapshot | playwright | browser_snapshot |
| browser_fill | playwright | browser_type |
| browser_click | playwright | browser_click |
| browser_take_screenshot | playwright | browser_take_screenshot |
| browser_console_messages | playwright | browser_console_messages |
| browser_wait_for | playwright | browser_wait_for |

## Правило вызова

1. Навык указывает capability — используй эту таблицу для выбора server + tool.
2. Схему вызова (arguments) бери из IDE tool list.
3. Если capability отсутствует в таблице или tool недоступен — сообщи пользователю.
